# CachedAppOptimizer (system_server thread that manages cached-app
# freezing/compaction) searches /proc/irq as part of its optimization
# passes; denied on this device tree since it wasn't paired with
# AlphaDroid's own device/alpha sepolicy. Likely contributor to the
# periodic OomAdjuster StrictMode DiskReadViolation churn observed live.
# Lives here (not ../private/system_server.te): proc_irq is declared by
# MediaTek's vendor sepolicy (device/mediatek/sepolicy_vndr), and
# system_ext/private policy compiles before vendor policy - referencing a
# vendor type from private fails with "unknown type" at build time.
allow system_server proc_irq:dir search;
